Date: Tue, 16 Dec 2025 00:03:06 +0530
Subject: chore: restore canvas noise infrastructure from before deletion

Restore canvas noise files that were deleted in Chromium commit
c4435dd289abf (Oct 31, 2025) as part of Privacy Sandbox deprecation.

These files provide the browser-side infrastructure for canvas noise
fingerprinting protection feature including:
- Feature flags (kCanvasNoise)
- Browser token generation and storage (CanvasNoiseTokenData)
- Origin-specific token derivation
- BrowserContext integration

Files restored from commit c4435dd289abf^:
- components/fingerprinting_protection_filter/interventions/common/BUILD.gn
- components/fingerprinting_protection_filter/interventions/common/interventions_features.{cc,h}
- content/browser/fingerprinting_protection/DEPS
- content/browser/fingerprinting_protection/OWNERS
- content/browser/fingerprinting_protection/canvas_noise_token_data.{cc,h}
- content/browser/fingerprinting_protection/canvas_noise_token_data_browsertest.cc

